WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:01.440
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:06.930
At some point in human history, we realized
that if we left the cave door unlocked, someone

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:11.599
might come along and steal our collection
of bear skins and our favourite rock.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:12.990
So, what was the solution?

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:18.550
We couldn’t be everywhere at once so perhaps
we needed a group of people to watch our cave,

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.160
prevent rock theft and make sure no one rode
a mammoth too quickly through a pedestrian

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.300
zone.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:29.600
Unfortunately, although rock theft declined,
this new cave watching group became suspiciously

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.670
well dressed and were getting all the best
bits of antelope at the nightly barbeque.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:39.730
Police corruption has been an issue throughout
the ages because as the Roman poet Juvenal

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:43.100
once wrote “who watches the watchmen?”

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.690
Good policing undoubtedly makes our lives
better and easier but it’s a difficult balancing

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.020
act to get right.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.820
So whether it’s making money on the side,
avoiding blame for suspicious wrongdoings

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:03.289
or a belief that the end justifies the means,
today we look at four massive police cover

00:01:03.289 --> 00:01:09.090
ups from around the world.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:15.039
Los Angeles has a lot of gangs and, if it
wasn’t for all the drugs, violence and murder,

00:01:15.039 --> 00:01:18.139
the amount of diversity on show would almost
make you proud.

00:01:18.139 --> 00:01:23.740
There’s the Bloods and the Crips, the Wah
Ching and other triads, the unimaginatively

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:30.299
named White Power group; Nazi Lowriders, MS-13
and plenty of other Latino gangs.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:35.859
There’s also the terrifying Los Angeles
Wargamers who’s army of Dark Elves and endless

00:01:35.859 --> 00:01:41.169
grain resource cards have terrorised the board
game community for years; you can take their

00:01:41.169 --> 00:01:43.459
lives, but no one will ever take their virginities.

00:01:43.459 --> 00:01:51.539
To tackle this smorgasbord of criminal sub-groups,
the LAPD assigned each division an anti-gang

00:01:51.539 --> 00:01:59.119
team called Community Resources Against Street
Hoodlums, or CRASH, which began in 1979.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:03.950
When officer Kevin Gaines, of the Rampart
division, was shot by an undercover officer

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:10.369
in 1997, the subsequent investigation revealed
a police unit that didn’t just have one

00:02:10.369 --> 00:02:14.299
or two bad apples, the whole barrel was rotten.

00:02:14.299 --> 00:02:19.930
The Rampart scandal revealed that the Rampart
CRASH team had planted false evidence, performed

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:26.870
unprovoked shootings and beatings, stolen
and dealt narcotics, lied in court, committed

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.239
bank robbery and more.

00:02:29.239 --> 00:02:33.910
In trying to give gang members a lengthy rap
sheet, they had actually written their own.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:40.630
A number of officers moonlighted as security
for the hip-hop record label Death Row Records,

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.450
which had links to the Bloods gang.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:46.930
It’s possible that some of these officers
were even involved in the execution of Biggie

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:47.939
Smalls.

00:02:47.939 --> 00:02:57.010
The LAPD had a real mess to clean up and eventually
paid out $125 million in civil lawsuits, disciplined

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:03.450
around 25 officers and a handful went to jail,
including Rafael Perez who snitched on all

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:07.909
the other officers in exchange for a reduced
sentence.

00:03:07.909 --> 00:03:14.200
On 15 April 1989, the worst disaster in British
sporting history happened at Hillsborough

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:20.640
football stadium in Sheffield, when 96 Liverpool
fans were crushed to death during an FA cup

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.930
semi-final game.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:27.610
Nowadays, every team in the top two leagues
must have all-seater stadium, largely in reaction

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:29.090
to this tragedy.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:34.920
On the day, two pens with Liverpool fans were
already very full but there were still a lot

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:39.329
of fans outside the turnstiles when the game
was close to kick-off.

00:03:39.329 --> 00:03:45.549
These fans were all directed into the overcrowded
pens and the ensuing jam of people crushed

00:03:45.549 --> 00:03:50.520
everyone so tightly that many suffocated.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.749
Initially the fans were blamed.

00:03:52.749 --> 00:03:58.540
The Sun newspaper, owned by Australian media
vampire Rupert Murdoch, printed a front page,

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:04.400
headlined “The Truth” that claimed Liverpool
fans had pickpocketed the victims, urinated

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:08.719
on police and even prevented them from giving
CPR to the injured.

00:04:08.719 --> 00:04:14.209
All of these were proved to be completely
false and The Sun newspaper is still boycotted

00:04:14.209 --> 00:04:16.359
across the city of Liverpool to this day.

00:04:16.359 --> 00:04:21.470
But it wasn’t just The Sun who were wrong,
the police, led by David Duckenfield on the

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:27.340
day, spent decades pushing the blame onto
drunken Liverpool fans and fans without tickets.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:33.151
Duckenfield claimed that the fans forced their
way in through a large exit gate, when in

00:04:33.151 --> 00:04:38.610
fact he himself had ordered it to be opened
to relieve the bottleneck that was building

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:43.509
up outside, ignoring the fatal crush happening
inside the gate.

00:04:43.509 --> 00:04:48.930
In 2012, an independent report was finally
published, bringing the truth to light and

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:54.669
in August this year, an investigation began
into Duckenfield, revealing the police force’s

00:04:54.669 --> 00:05:01.210
utter disregard for people’s safety on that
tragic day when 96 innocent spectators were

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.900
crushed to death, because of negligence.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.000
There are even reports that the Freemasons
had a hand in allowing the disaster to happen.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.880
Now we head to the heart of the Caucasus,
the beautiful country of Georgia.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:14.810
After the collapse of the Soviet Union, Georgia
was in a pretty bad state.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:19.660
It may have had hundreds of stunning mountains,
a rich history of wine making and a national

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.430
food called khachapuri (“Ka-cha-PUER-I”)
that is a bread boat filled with cheese and

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:30.879
topped with a fried egg, but sadly, in this
sick and twisted world, that is not enough.

00:05:30.879 --> 00:05:37.350
Large gangs controlled much of the country
but that all changed when Mikheil Saakashvili

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:42.750
(“Sar-cash-vee-li”) became president in
January 2004, following the non-violent Revolution

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.370
of Roses in November 2003.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:49.379
He promised to end police corruption and gang
control.

00:05:49.379 --> 00:05:54.850
And he did, by scrapping the entire police
force and starting again.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:06:01.039
A fellow revolutionary Batu Kuteli explained
the reasons for this radical overhaul when

00:06:01.039 --> 00:06:07.849
he compared tackling corruption to “building
a ship in the middle of the sea while sailing,

00:06:07.849 --> 00:06:12.259
while also learning how to sail, and while
you have somebody attacking and trying to

00:06:12.259 --> 00:06:14.470
sink your ship.”

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.870
Excellent point, you can see why they got
the boat…

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:17.949
I mean vote.

00:06:17.949 --> 00:06:23.880
The trouble was, his new force were a little
too motivated and before too long corruption

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:29.919
was gone, because they basically locked everyone
up, ending up with the highest per capita

00:06:29.919 --> 00:06:32.509
prison population in Europe.

00:06:32.509 --> 00:06:39.580
In March 2006, police claimed to have prevented
a riot by the inmates in Tbilisi prison, organized

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.909
by gang leaders.

00:06:40.909 --> 00:06:47.199
But they did it by preventing seven inmates
from continuing to live, as well as injuring

00:06:47.199 --> 00:06:48.199
17.

00:06:48.199 --> 00:06:53.949
There was also mass surveillance, telephone
tapping and torture.

00:06:53.949 --> 00:07:00.800
There are a number of big British secrets,
such as; why do we eat marmite and why do

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:04.289
we play all of America’s super heroes in
films.

00:07:04.289 --> 00:07:10.900
But the story of the Mau Mau was one of our
closest guarded secrets, where the actions

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:17.130
of the colonial police and military in Kenya
were mostly suppressed for over fifty years.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:23.569
In the early 1950s, the native Kenyan population,
particularly the Kikuyu people, thought that

00:07:23.569 --> 00:07:27.890
the British might relax their occupation a
little, especially after the Kenyans had fought

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.939
for them in WWII.

00:07:29.939 --> 00:07:35.139
Obviously, they had never been overly delighted
at being colonized, people are often not as

00:07:35.139 --> 00:07:39.229
grateful as you’d think when you move into
their house and eat all their food, even if

00:07:39.229 --> 00:07:42.120
you do have an excellent collection of moustaches.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:47.550
A rebel group called the Mau Mau appeared,
killing around 200 Europeans and colonial

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.759
sympathizers.

00:07:48.759 --> 00:07:54.349
The Brits used propaganda to paint the Mau
Mau as evil boogey men, framing their activity

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:57.320
as part of a civil war among the Kikuyu.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:02.770
In order to protect loyal Kikuyu and control
the rebels, they moved over one million Kenyans

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:08.320
into village camps that were effectively giant
gulags, with living conditions dependent on

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.120
how loyal they believed each person to be.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:16.620
They use white settlers to control the camps
and there was mass scale torture and execution.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:21.099
It’s shocking enough on its own but the
fact that it was less than a decade since

00:08:21.099 --> 00:08:25.840
the horrors of Nazi Germany had come to light,
the hypocrisy was probably the main reason

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.110
why the stories and documents were buried.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:34.380
It’s thought that over 20,000 Kenyans died
and some 5000 more tortured.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:41.460
Barrack Obama’s grandfather, Hussein Onyango
Obama, had pins forced into his fingernails

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:47.240
and his testicles squeezed between rods, while
two other men with him were castrated.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:52.820
You see, the UK &amp; US really do have a “special
relationship”, we go way back.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:59.160
It wasn’t until 2011 that a landmark court
case, of Kenyan victims against the British

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:02.010
government, brought much of the evidence to
light.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:06.280
It turned out that many documents had been
kept in a government building in Hanslope

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:11.520
Park, probably brought back by colonials who
disagreed with what was happening and wanted

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.640
it on record that they had complained.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:19.780
So, it just goes to show, you can’t always
trust the men in blue, and remember, you always

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:24.710
have a voice, so if you’re being oppressed,
speak up for yourself – unless the men in

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.630
blue are pointing guns at you, then you should
probably shut the hell up.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:47.810
Thanks for the view, subscribe for more Thoughty2.

